  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p class=\"p1\" id=\"isPasted\"><span class=\"s1\">About our brand and products:</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">AXK Maternity redefines maternity wear with elevated essentials that blend luxury, performance, and timeless style. Each piece is crafted to support women from bump to beyond.</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">What makes us different:</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">We merge high-quality fabrics with elegant design, creating versatile sets that transition effortlessly from active to everyday wear—without compromising comfort or sophistication.</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">How affiliates can earn:</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">Earn commissions on every referral through your personalized code or link, while aligning with a brand that celebrates women in every stage of motherhood.</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">How to promote us:</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">Share AXK across your social platforms and lifestyle content to inspire confidence and style in moms and moms-to-be.</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Other information:</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">As an affiliate, you’ll receive exclusive assets, early access to launches, and a luxury discount code for your community.</span></p></div>",
